WEBVTT

00:01:57.079 --> 00:02:01.413
And yet, the concept of trust
has never been so fashionable.

00:02:02.871 --> 00:02:04.621
But what is trust, really?

00:02:04.996 --> 00:02:06.704
Is it a feeling,

00:02:06.704 --> 00:02:09.913
an invisible part
of our human DNA or culture,

00:02:09.954 --> 00:02:13.954
or this quasi-spiritual thing,
like the Force in Star Wars?

00:02:14.704 --> 00:02:17.413
Or is it really something more concrete?

00:02:18.079 --> 00:02:19.913
I am an engineer and a consultant --

00:02:19.954 --> 00:02:22.621
worse still, with a PhD --
sorry about that.

00:02:23.038 --> 00:02:27.121
I study the structures and systems
of businesses and organizations.

00:02:27.163 --> 00:02:28.871
So, a couple of years ago,

00:02:28.913 --> 00:02:32.204
I started wondering
whether we could decode and manage